    "description": "GP and GPE series of multi-divisional non-automatic weighing instruments, mains or battery powered, accuracy class III, price-computing, stand-alone instruments intended for direct sales to the public. Maximum capacities are between 3 kg and 3000 kg. Construction depends on the model number; the designation follows the format 'Family'+'suffix', where the family is GP or GPE and the suffix comprises alphanumeric characters identifying different variants. Features include environmental protection against dust, water and insects; LCD, LED and touch displays; high-speed thermal printer; die-cast chassis and plastic housing containing the load cell and electronics; stainless steel and aluminium load receptor; mechanical and membrane keyboard; level indicator."
